| opentelemetry-collector | exporter/exporterhelper/metrics.go | **Exporter helper** - Creates exporter.Metrics instances. Must update to support ConsumeMetricsWithContext. |
| opentelemetry-collector | processor/processorhelper/traces.go | **Processor helper for traces** - Should be updated for consistency with traces. |
